{
  "_comment": [
    "Carte du site : chaque entrée est un projet qui vit dans son propre repo et",
    "qui est cloné/buildé au moment de la publication (voir tools/build-site.sh).",
    "Rien de tout ça n'est versionné ici — publier un projet = pousser dans SON repo.",
    "",
    "  path    dossier servi sous https://9mp.org/<path>/",
    "  repo    owner/nom sur GitHub",
    "  ref     branche à publier",
    "  build   commande à lancer dans le clone (optionnel)",
    "  output  fichier ou dossier à publier (défaut : la racine du clone)",
    "  as      nom de destination quand output est un fichier",
    "  exclude chemins à ne pas publier, relatifs à output",
    "",
    "L'ordre compte : une entrée imbriquée (hellochat/expert-comments) doit venir",
    "après celle qui la contient."
  ],
  "sites": [
    {
      "path": "abadie",
      "repo": "grafmik/abadie",
      "ref": "main",
      "output": "public"
    },
    {
      "path": "adx",
      "repo": "grafmik/adx",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "CLAUDE.md", "build.py", "scripts", "data/*.json"]
    },
    {
      "path": "baston",
      "repo": "grafmik/baston",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "beatemall",
      "repo": "grafmik/beatemall",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tests", "server", ".gitignore"]
    },
    {
      "path": "croco-kata",
      "repo": "grafmik/blender",
      "ref": "main",
      "output": "site"
    },
    {
      "path": "fisc",
      "repo": "grafmik/fisc",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "cyber-nepia",
      "repo": "grafmik/cyber-nepia",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "art", "tools", ".gitignore"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ulysse31",
      "repo": "grafmik/ulysse31",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "superclip", "ulyss31-2"]
    },
    {
      "path": "soi-6-starship",
      "repo": "grafmik/soi-6-starship",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": [
        "README.md",
        "tools",
        "tests",
        ".gitignore",
        ".claude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "berceuse",
      "repo": "grafmik/horror",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "damgod",
      "repo": "grafmik/damgod",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tools", "tests", "bible", "song"]
    },
    {
      "path": "devilcrunch",
      "repo": "grafmik/devilcrunch",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tools", "tests", ".gitignore"]
    },
    {
      "path": "animations-2d",
      "repo": "grafmik/2d-animation",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "python3 tools/build_9mp.py",
      "output": "site"
    },
    {
      "path": "flat",
      "repo": "grafmik/flat",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "immomap",
      "repo": "grafmik/immomap",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "URL_SITE=https://9mp.org/immomap GUICHET=aucun node site/build.mjs",
      "output": "public"
    },
    {
      "path": "joypad-test",
      "repo": "grafmik/joypad-test",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "jobs",
      "repo": "grafmik/jobs",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "node build.mjs",
      "output": "dist/atlas-des-metiers.html",
      "as": "index.html"
    },
    {
      "path": "martingale",
      "repo": "grafmik/martingale",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "menage",
      "repo": "grafmik/menage",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "pizzeria105",
      "repo": "grafmik/pizzeria105",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "prompts"]
    },
    {
      "path": "shmups",
      "repo": "grafmik/nebula-strike",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "node deepseek4/tools/build.js",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "deepseek4/test", "deepseek4/tools"]
    },
    {
      "path": "rewind-raid",
      "repo": "grafmik/rewind-raid",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "killer-kombat",
      "repo": "grafmik/killer-kombat",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tools", "tests", ".gitignore", ".github"]
    },
    {
      "path": "kombat17",
      "repo": "grafmik/kombat17",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "tools", ".gitignore", ".github"]
    },
    {
      "path": "rage-in-the-city-2",
      "repo": "grafmik/rage-in-the-city-2",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tools", "tests", "art/turnarounds", "art/reference", ".gitignore"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ultraroad",
      "repo": "grafmik/ultraroad",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "package.json", "tools"]
    },
    {
      "path": "wallet-compare",
      "repo": "grafmik/wallet-compare",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "BILAN.md", "build.py", "build_securite.py"]
    },
    {
      "path": "zero-latency",
      "repo": "grafmik/zero-latency",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "python3 scripts/build.py",
      "output": "build/site"
    },
    {
      "path": "hellochat",
      "repo": "grafmik/hellochat",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "flutter build web --release --base-href /hellochat/",
      "output": "build/web"
    },
    {
      "path": "hellochat/expert-comments",
      "repo": "grafmik/hellochat",
      "ref": "expert-comments",
      "build": "flutter build web --release --base-href /hellochat/expert-comments/",
      "output": "build/web"
    },
    {
      "path": "sceptre-noir",
      "repo": "grafmik/sceptre-noir",
      "ref": "main",
      "output": "sceptre-noir.html",
      "as": "index.html"
    },
    {
      "path": "vigie",
      "repo": "grafmik/vigie",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md", "vigie.py", "classement.json", "template.html", "data", ".gitignore"]
    },
    {
      "path": "bd",
      "repo": "grafmik/bd",
      "ref": "main",
      "output": "site"
    },
    {
      "path": "affiliation",
      "repo": "grafmik/affiliation",
      "ref": "main",
      "exclude": ["README.md"]
    },
    {
      "path": "auto",
      "repo": "grafmik/auto",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "SITE_URL=https://9mp.org/auto node src/build.mjs",
      "output": "dist"
    },
    {
      "path": "iq-by-claude",
      "repo": "grafmik/iq-by-claude",
      "ref": "main",
      "build": "npm ci && npm run build -- --base /iq-by-claude --site https://9mp.org",
      "output": "dist"
    }
  ]
}
